{"3844350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bside 中文版", "steam_appid": 3844350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bside is a cozy, lightweight life sim where you start by creating your own Biibit: a virtual companion who can live right on your desktop. Bside offers hundreds of customizable options for looks and personality, while your Biibit evolves through interaction, leading to a one-of-a-kind companion just for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844350/extras/e5e6160fb0134aa6614cfa895132c8dd.avif?t=1763090982\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844350/extras_big/e5e6160fb0134aa6614cfa895132c8dd.avif?t=1763090982 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design spaces where you can watch Biibits form friendships through unscripted interaction, or let them live freely on your desktop while you work or play. Bside is not about control. It’s about liberating our players (you) while enabling you to discover your B side through the lives of your Biibit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844350/extras/8655a1a85ca65811a665c71afbd536e1.webp?t=1763090982\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844350/extras/8655a1a85ca65811a665c71afbd536e1.poster.avif?t=1763090982\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=348 /></picture></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844350/extras/e9e3c52c5aa4eeee7e607b6e4a02e5f0.avif?t=1763090982\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844350/extras_big/e9e3c52c5aa4eeee7e607b6e4a02e5f0.avif?t=1763090982 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bside is a cozy, lightweight life sim where you start by creating your own Biibit: a virtual companion who can live right on your desktop. Bside offers hundreds of customizable options for looks and personality, while your Biibit evolves through interaction, leading to a one-of-a-kind companion just for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844350/extras/e5e6160fb0134aa6614cfa895132c8dd.avif?t=1763090982\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844350/extras_big/e5e6160fb0134aa6614cfa895132c8dd.avif?t=1763090982 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design spaces where you can watch Biibits form friendships through unscripted interaction, or let them live freely on your desktop while you work or play. Bside is not about control. It’s about liberating our players (you) while enabling you to discover your B side through the lives of your Biibit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844350/extras/8655a1a85ca65811a665c71afbd536e1.webp?t=1763090982\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844350/extras/8655a1a85ca65811a665c71afbd536e1.poster.avif?t=1763090982\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=348 /></picture></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844350/extras/e9e3c52c5aa4eeee7e607b6e4a02e5f0.avif?t=1763090982\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844350/extras_big/e9e3c52c5aa4eeee7e607b6e4a02e5f0.avif?t=1763090982 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Meet your Biibit: your virtual buddy who lives and grows on your desktop. They aren’t here to be controlled, but their autonomous growth might lead you to discover your B side.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844350/ff9ef2cf6349e68c23ab5334e74658b7a5dc3bb3/header.jpg?t=1763090982", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844350/63f7b7fdee851bf0027b2cc8d93ace3c70c29d0c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763090982", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844350/63f7b7fdee851bf0027b2cc8d93ace3c70c29d0c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763090982", "website": "https://bside.zone/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10+, 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5 or AMD Ryzen 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 Ti (4GB) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Yes, please</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10+, 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i7 or AMD Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 2060 (8GB) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Y